                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <http://w3id.org/trajecto/purpose#DomesticActivity> ;
                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> :TrajectoryPurposeScheme ;
                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Domestic Activity"@en .


###  http://w3id.org/trajecto/purpose/skos#EducationalPurpose
:EducationalPurpose rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
